## IChatConfigurationService

**Namespace**: `Cyrena.Contracts`
**Assembly**: `Cyrena.Core`

### Purpose
Provides access to the current chat's persistent `ChatConfiguration`. Kernel-locked (one instance per chat).

### Properties
| Property | Type | Description |
|----------|------|-------------|
| `Config` | `ChatConfiguration` | The active chat's configuration object |

### Methods

#### SaveConfigurationAsync()
Persists the current `Config` to storage.

```csharp
Task SaveConfigurationAsync();
```

### Usage
```csharp
public class MyService
{
    private readonly IChatConfigurationService _configService;

    public MyService(IChatConfigurationService configService)
    {
        _configService = configService;
    }

    public void UpdateTitle(string title)
    {
        _configService.Config.Title = title;
        _configService.SaveConfigurationAsync();
    }
}
```

